    given-names: "Marcus Emmanuel"
version: "0.1.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22167424"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MarcusBarnes/elliptic_rank_search"
abstract: "Research software for exact and heuristic computational searches for elliptic curves over Q with large Mordell-Weil rank, with public workflows emphasizing candidate generation, reproducibility, and separation of heuristic evidence from rigorous rank certification."
keywords:
  - elliptic curves
  - Mordell-Weil rank
  - computational number theory
  - SageMath
  - PARI/GP
  - Mestre-Nagao score
  - reproducible research software
